_Thunder_Damage\"> Condition: Absorb Elements: Thunder Damage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absorb_Elements:_Thunder_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorb Elements: Thunder Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Absorb Elements: Thunder Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Absorb_Elements_Thunder_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Absorb_Elements:_Thunder_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Absorb Elements: Thunder Damage (Condition)\">Absorb Elements: Thunder Damage</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage the next time it deals damage with a weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Cloak of Elemental Absorption\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Cloak of Elemental Absorption\">Cloak of Elemental Absorption</a></span> </li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Cloak of the Weave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Cloak_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Cloak of the Weave\">Cloak of the Weave</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction halves damage by granting <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to the elemental damage type when triggered. Since resistances do not stack, this will not reduce the damage further if the user already has the applicable resistances.</li>\n<li>Absorb Elements can apply its damage bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">multiple times</a> to a single weapon attack.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction cannot be used while affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/40px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Starry Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/20px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\">Starry Form</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714161609\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.156 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.169 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5125/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 91729/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 38818/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 39/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1628435/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n140.95%  195.209  